{"about_the_game":"Break open crates. Grab weapons. Dual wield anything. Wreck zombies.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Fight.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Smash, shoot, and blow up zombies. Or just beat them down with punches and kicks.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Harvest.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Break zombies into pieces of meat. Harvest and transport the zombie meat to be used as bait for fish and crabs.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Fish.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Use zombie meat as fishing bait for automatic fishing systems. Load zombie meat into traps to catch crabs. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Sell-2.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Automate your logistics with conveyor belts, robots, and teleporters to deliver your catch. Monitor seafood prices on the market to maximize profits.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Buy.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Buy transport robots and automation systems (conveyor belts, teleporters, fishing gear). Upgrade ammunition capacity, ammunition type, melee weapons, high explosives, fighting skills, health, robots, and more.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419660?t=1746023919","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/a2bb7ab712dc4ab5b3747e8a73d8c5d0cd93d57e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746023919","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/5c28798f3bba3be1ea12e53a17208e71176f736b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746023919","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/5c28798f3bba3be1ea12e53a17208e71176f736b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746023919","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Break open crates. Grab weapons. Dual wield anything. Wreck zombies.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Fight.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Smash, shoot, and blow up zombies. Or just beat them down with punches and kicks.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Harvest.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Break zombies into pieces of meat. Harvest and transport the zombie meat to be used as bait for fish and crabs.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Fish.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Use zombie meat as fishing bait for automatic fishing systems. Load zombie meat into traps to catch crabs. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Sell-2.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Automate your logistics with conveyor belts, robots, and teleporters to deliver your catch. Monitor seafood prices on the market to maximize profits.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/GIF-Buy.gif?t=1746023919\" /><br>Buy transport robots and automation systems (conveyor belts, teleporters, fishing gear). Upgrade ammunition capacity, ammunition type, melee weapons, high explosives, fighting skills, health, robots, and more.","developers":["Chris Danelon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akama